Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.17,0:00:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to do
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.61,0:01:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.27,0:01:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.63,0:01:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's us, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.73,0:01:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.37,0:01:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a hospital?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.35,0:01:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Did someone get hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.95,0:01:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Joey, someone was\Nknocked unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.11,0:01:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.37,0:01:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I pass out?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.91,0:01:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that why everyone's so happy to see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.39,0:01:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.25,0:01:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.87,0:01:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.78,0:01:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.99,0:01:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're awake. Me too, me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.43,0:01:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,three You scared us This is impossible\NYou can't be awake Someone in
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.53,0:01:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,your condition could never recover\Nthis fast Don't ever pull this again,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.75,0:01:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.79,0:01:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.79,0:01:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,you had the girls really worried Of course,\NI knew you'd make it all along Tristan?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.25,0:02:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait. I think I remember. I was\Ndueling. It was me against Marek,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.19,0:02:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,and I was fighting to save Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.19,0:02:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But why is she still sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.05,0:02:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.09,0:02:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.25,0:02:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mind's supposed to be\Nback from the Shadow Realm!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.99,0:02:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I was sure that defeating\NMarek would save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.03,0:02:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I did defeat Marek, didn't I? Didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.49,0:02:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, just give it to me straight, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.19,0:02:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember I had that\Nweirdo beat, um, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.19,0:02:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, I'm afraid you lost.\NMaric won. There's no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.03,0:02:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,i know i won i summoned gearfree the iron
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.21,0:02:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,knight and crushed him\Nplease joey just listen
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.47,0:02:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,you guys were playing a\Nshadow game and you almost won
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.23,0:02:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,but maric was wearing you\Ndown by draining your energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.53,0:02:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But then, with your last bit of strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.33,0:03:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,you were able to summon a monster\Nstrong enough to beat Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.49,0:03:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But before you had a chance to call\Nout your attack, you passed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.43,0:03:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.15,0:03:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That psycho actually beat me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.45,0:03:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave it my all, Mai. I'm sorry. I tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.17,0:03:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But this thing is far from over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.55,0:03:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Rescue Copter 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.47,0:03:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We are descending upon Kaiba Corp Island\Nto transport the critical patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.95,0:03:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Yugi, but you're still at\Na huge disadvantage in this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.21,0:03:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.51,0:03:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks to me like we both have\Ntwo monsters on the field Perhaps,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.61,0:03:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,but my two blue eyes are more\Npowerful than either of your creatures
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.93,0:03:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll place two cards face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.09,0:03:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Your move, Yugi
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.25,0:04:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,With these cards in place,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.45,0:04:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi will never escape. Kaiba's\Ndefinitely up to something. But what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.87,0:04:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got a long way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.77,0:04:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba This magic card could\Ncome in handy later but for
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.57,0:04:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,now I have his two blue-eyes\Nwhite dragons to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.77,0:04:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,They could do some serious damage,\Nso I have to protect my life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.95,0:04:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place this face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.97,0:04:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,and then I'll switch my red-eyes\Nblack dragon into defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.93,0:04:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.73,0:04:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate my trap guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.95,0:04:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not that trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.45,0:04:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It returns my red-eyes\Nback to attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.71,0:04:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's worse than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.93,0:04:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as my final attack\Norder's trap card is in play,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.81,0:04:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,every monster on the field\Nstays in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.87,0:04:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And next, we each choose any three cards\Nwe want in order to form a new deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.51,0:04:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And the rest of our deck\Ngoes to the card graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.77,0:04:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Our whole deck!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.33,0:05:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That means this duel comes to\Nan end in three more turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.01,0:05:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,These three cards are more than\Nenough to ensure my victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.33,0:05:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,In a few short moments, I'll crush\NYugi and reclaim my number one status!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.95,0:05:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, you may as well give\Nup and accept defeat now, Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.03,0:05:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,because my strategy is unstoppable!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.15,0:05:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I can only choose three of these cards to\Nhold onto, and everything else goes away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.15,0:05:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,My fate depends on this choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.31,0:05:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.89,0:05:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Did his duel start yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.69,0:05:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, he's dueling against\NKaiba right now! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.33,0:05:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then I got to get\Nup there and help him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.01,0:05:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.37,0:05:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya, it's no use trying\Nto talk me out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.99,0:05:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He needs me! Joey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.17,0:05:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, get back in bed right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.07,0:05:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba Corp Emergency Squad! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.13,0:05:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here to transport the patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.05,0:05:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.13,0:05:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, right here. Huh? Him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.87,0:05:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he was in critical\Ncondition a minute ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.79,0:06:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be lying, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.15,0:06:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Five minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.47,0:06:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm doing fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.89,0:06:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in the best shape of my career, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.47,0:06:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at these pythons.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.21,0:06:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.31,0:06:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous for you to leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.61,0:06:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You still need an examination.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.15,0:06:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.45,0:06:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.17,0:06:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.41,0:06:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.31,0:06:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.79,0:06:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, you should stay back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.89,0:06:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, just listen to\Nwhat the doctor says.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.73,0:06:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop worrying, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.25,0:06:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see I'm all right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.07,0:06:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.37,0:06:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You were just in really bad shape, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.69,0:06:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and all of us were worried sick about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.39,0:06:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And now you're going to stand there\Nand pretend that everything's fine?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.71,0:06:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just so many people have been hurt\Nbecause of this tournament, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.97,0:06:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.83,0:06:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have to go and be there for Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.83,0:06:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.21,0:06:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But, Joey...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.75,0:06:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I know I had you all scared,\Nbut I came back for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.13,0:06:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.04,0:07:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I made a promise to Yugi when\Nthis whole thing started.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.05,0:07:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I'd help him defeat\NMarek and save the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.93,0:07:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,He does need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.49,0:07:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.97,0:07:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I joined this tournament to save mankind,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.17,0:07:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,and Joey vowed to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.21,0:07:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Please understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.03,0:07:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This is about more than\Njust my pride, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.97,0:07:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about being true to my promise, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.47,0:07:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only would I be letting Yugi down,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.87,0:07:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be letting down every\Nsingle person on Earth, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.87,0:07:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,If Marek wins this tournament, he'll have\Nenough power to cause some major damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.55,0:07:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's no way we can let that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.77,0:07:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.83,0:07:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm afraid my mind's made up, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.51,0:07:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going out there now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.51,0:07:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.61,0:07:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, don't just stand there. Go. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.67,0:07:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care of my serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.41,0:07:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, and be careful out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.59,0:07:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, hey, come back here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.99,0:07:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.87,0:07:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait up, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.91,0:07:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.63,0:08:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I need a new career.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.19,0:08:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I can only keep three cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.99,0:08:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wish I knew which\Nthree cards Kaiba chose.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.93,0:08:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to figure out his strategy in\Norder to come up with a way to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.15,0:08:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.06,0:08:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were Kaiba, what would I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.07,0:08:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got two blue-eyes\Nwhite dragons on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.63,0:08:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,so I bet he'll want to bring his\Nthird one back from the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.29,0:08:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,For that, he'll need Monster Reborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.37,0:08:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he'll probably want to fuse them all
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.63,0:08:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,together to form\NBlue-Eye's Ultimate Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.25,0:08:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And for that, he'll need\Na Polymerization card.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.99,0:08:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But who knows if that's really his plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.41,0:08:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh well, I have to do something,\Nso I'll pick these three cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.51,0:08:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll hope for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.47,0:08:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all up to destiny now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.83,0:08:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your move, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.53,0:08:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It took you long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.21,0:08:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you realize that it doesn't\Nmatter what cards you're holding?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.47,0:08:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.65,0:08:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Now stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.37,0:09:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready because it's time\Nfor the fun part. Enjoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.23,0:09:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,i play the magic card\Nmonster reborn i knew it
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.45,0:09:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,i take it you're aware\Nof which monster i'm
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.21,0:09:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,planning to bring back\Nfrom my card graveyard
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.73,0:09:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,my blue eyes white dragon now i have three
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.85,0:09:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Next I'll activate this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.85,0:09:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,If he already had polymerization on\Nthe field, then what's in his deck?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.63,0:09:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I shall fuse my three dragons together
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.97,0:09:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Say hello to my blue eyes ultimate dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.41,0:09:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing you do can stop\Nmy three headed beast
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.29,0:09:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.39,0:09:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Karpon's strongest monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.29,0:09:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And I have nothing on the\Nfield that can beat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.67,0:09:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I better think of something fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.77,0:09:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Look closely,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.99,0:10:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,for this is the creature that will strip
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.11,0:10:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,you of everything you\Nhave once and for all!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.27,0:10:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I have you exactly where I want you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.41,0:10:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Trembling in fear before my\Nblue-eyes, ultimate dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.95,0:10:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, I've played out this exact moment\Nin my mind over and over and over again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.75,0:10:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, here we are at the top\Nof my duel tower, face to face!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.91,0:10:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And all you have to hang onto is\Nsome rock from 5,000 years ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.15,0:10:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're right, this\Nduel is about the past!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.27,0:10:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true! I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.73,0:10:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's not about some ancient\Nbattle you think we fought
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.05,0:10:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,in another life because you\Nsaw a picture on a stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.95,0:10:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,When I say this duel is about the past, I\Nmean it's about burying the past for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.45,0:10:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.36,0:10:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,once I defeat you and go on to win this\Ntournament, I'll be number one, not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.51,0:10:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.63,0:10:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but there's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.35,0:11:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll also be closing the book on my\Npast so I can concentrate on my future.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.57,0:11:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.77,0:11:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,ever since I was dropped off\Nat the orphanage as a child,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.05,0:11:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had to fend for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.61,0:11:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to toughen up to protect Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.07,0:11:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, we were adopted by a\Ntyrant known as Gozoboro Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.69,0:11:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He taught me to crush my\Nenemies and trust no one,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.91,0:11:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,but nothing I ever did satisfied him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.63,0:11:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So using the ruthless business\Ntechniques he taught me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.31,0:11:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I outsmarted him and\Ntook over his company.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.49,0:11:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Kaiba Corp belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.47,0:11:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's long gone, but that's\Nstill not good enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.43,0:11:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one conquest I need to fulfill And\Nthat's where you come in, Yugi So listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.89,0:11:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the best at everything\Nthat I do But when
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.51,0:11:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,it comes to being the\Nbest at duel monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.89,0:11:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,you are in my way So once I beat\Nyou, I can forget the past for good
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.91,0:11:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.91,0:12:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I never knew Seto felt so\Nstrongly about our past
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.01,0:12:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I know things weren't easy back\Nthen But we did have each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.31,0:12:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that wasn't good enough for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.65,0:12:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants to forget everything,\Nincluding the person he used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.09,0:12:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But I liked Seto back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.15,0:12:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He actually used to smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.25,0:12:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he wants to get rid\Nof that smile forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.89,0:12:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto needs to realize that reaching the\Ntop doesn't have to mean being miserable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.67,0:12:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Face it, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.01,0:12:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Your reign is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.95,0:12:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You never cease to amaze me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.81,0:12:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you astounded by my superior\Ndueling skills, Yugi? Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.35,0:12:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your complete stubbornness and your\Nlust for power that I find so puzzling.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.77,0:12:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.68,0:12:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.65,0:12:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It holds you back. That's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.35,0:12:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never defeat me with a\Nheart full of hatred and mistrust.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.53,0:12:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just trying to distract me\Nbecause you're scared of losing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.29,0:13:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't I let my action speak for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.53,0:13:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Reveal face down, Kar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.79,0:13:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,my double spell magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.73,0:13:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, not double spell. That's right,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.09,0:13:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,this card duplicates the effects of every\Nmagic card you used on your last turn,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.63,0:13:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.54,0:13:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That includes Monster\NReborn and Polymerization.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.67,0:13:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So first I'll bring Buster\NBlader back from the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.93,0:13:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll use Polymerization.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.93,0:13:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,fusing my Dark Magician\Nwith my Buster Blader.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.05,0:13:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Use whatever you want. My\Nultimate dragon is still
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.27,0:13:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,stronger your magic card\Ndidn't help you at all you're
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.91,0:13:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,wrong kaiba for my new\Nfusion monster carries with
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.75,0:13:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,it every one of buster\Nblader's special abilities
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.31,0:13:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,that means its attack\Nstrength increases by 500
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.69,0:13:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,points for every dragon on\Nthe field that includes your
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.45,0:13:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,blue eyes ultimate dragon\Nas well as my red eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.51,0:13:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Black dragon, now behold\Nthe power of Dark Paladin!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.57,0:14:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,the Ultimate Magical Swordsman!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.05,0:14:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Good move, Yugi, but\Nnot good enough. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.87,0:14:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Look closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.05,0:14:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your point, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.77,0:14:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Your monster may be powerful, but it's\Nstill 600 attack points weaker than mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.27,0:14:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall see. My move!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.19,0:14:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.77,0:14:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm depending on this card to win the\Nduel I hope it works Cause at this point,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.23,0:14:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my only chance for\Nvictory. I'll place one card
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.23,0:14:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Face down and end my turn. This\Nis where it all ends, Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.05,0:14:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.17,0:14:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,it's time to put an end to my past\Nfor good As soon as I win this,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.65,0:14:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I can finally move on How foolish!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.35,0:14:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our past that makes\Nus who we are today
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.41,0:14:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.63,0:14:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You must remember what happened before\Nso you can learn from your past.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.11,0:15:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't ignore where you came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.33,0:15:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.53,0:15:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our history that\Nshapes our future, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.31,0:15:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Save it, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.19,0:15:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to move on, not look back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.95,0:15:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The past is over, and nothing you\Nsay will change my mind, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.85,0:15:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to take you down now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.35,0:15:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Only then will I attain true greatness.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.09,0:15:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dual tower stands here,\Nsurrounded by rubble and destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.95,0:15:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And to me, it represents your heart, a\Nstrong object surrounded by anger and hatred.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.59,0:15:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And as long as you're fueled by\Nhate, you can never defeat me, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.39,0:15:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you realize my inner\Nrage pushes me forward?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.95,0:15:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's what I'll use to crush you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.49,0:15:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's the case, then go ahead and\Ndirect all of your hatred towards me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.51,0:15:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And strike me down with your rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.75,0:15:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.66,0:15:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But I assure you, you will live\Nto regret those words, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.95,0:16:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue Eyes Ultimate Dragon,\Nprepare for attack! This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.15,0:16:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't stop his dragon's\Nattack, this duel is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.61,0:16:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to believe in my\Nfriends and trust in myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.29,0:16:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,If I truly am destined to face Merrick,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.03,0:16:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,then there's no way Kaiba will win this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.81,0:16:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,My faith in the heart of the cards\Nwill overpower his hatred any day!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.47,0:16:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing can stand in\Nthe way of my destiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.41,0:16:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now my dragon, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.33,0:16:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I activate the face-down\Ncard, Magic Formula! How pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.11,0:16:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate Absorb Spell!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.35,0:16:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This magic card will absorb\Nthe power of Magic Formula!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.71,0:16:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.65,0:16:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,the attack points you\Njust added to your Dark
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.07,0:16:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Paladin will be transferred\Nto my Ultimate Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.25,0:16:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,His Blue Eyes Ultimate Dragon\Nis completely unstoppable
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.07,0:17:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now your history. Along\Nwith your Red Eyes and Dark
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.53,0:17:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Paladin the Ultimate\NMagical Swordsman. Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.21,0:17:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.39,0:17:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.65,0:17:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This doesn't look good Yugi
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.75,0:17:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I win. I wouldn't be so\Nsure of that. Remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.79,0:17:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have one\Nface-down card left Kaiba,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.45,0:17:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,you're done You lie As you will soon see,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.81,0:17:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been destined to defeat\Nyou for 5,000 years. Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.13,0:17:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,My Blue-Eyes Ultimate Dragon cannot be\Nstopped, Yugi. I'm afraid you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.31,0:17:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll let my card speak\Nfor itself. So, I play this
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.73,0:17:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,My D-Fusion card.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.37,0:17:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This magic card splits up your\NBlue-Eyes Ultimate Dragon Into the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.77,0:18:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,three original dragons you've used\Nto form it Thus stopping your attack
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.59,0:18:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I need my Ultimate Dragon to\Nwin the duel This can't be happening
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.49,0:18:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Kaiba, you have three dragons on the\Nfield instead of one, and since my dark
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.25,0:18:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,paladin receives 500\Nattack points for every
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.85,0:18:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,dragon on the field he's now the strongest
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.17,0:18:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,monster in play now it's time for my
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.87,0:18:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,final move just go with pleasure kaiba all
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.27,0:18:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,right the card in my hand will conquer to
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.65,0:18:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,the darkness that now\Nsurrounds your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.87,0:18:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So I play my final magic\Ncard, Diffusion Wave Motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.19,0:18:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.69,0:18:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,All I have to do is give\Nup 1,000 life points,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.71,0:18:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,and this magic card will enhance the\Nattacking capabilities of my Dark Paladin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.51,0:19:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now my monster can attack all three of\Nyour Blue-Eyes White Dragons at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.45,0:19:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,His Dark Paladin has enough power to\Nwipe out my dragons and my life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.09,0:19:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.19,0:19:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, I will not be defeated\Nat my own tournament!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.85,0:19:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, you're too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.09,0:19:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark paladin, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.69,0:19:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You lose, Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.77,0:19:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you your hatred and your\Nlust for power would never prevail.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.33,0:19:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.83,0:19:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,My toughest battle is still ahead\Nwhen I face Merrick in the final duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.67,0:20:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
